      "blocker": null,
      "detail": "CompactPlacement.lean (compact_placement): placements and support profiles over S_X (SameProfile = SupportProfile.Agree of SupportProfile.ofTerms; at most χ^σ = χ codes, mk_profileCode_le, since a well-order of size ≤ χ has ≤ χ cuts); continuations leaving every cluster intact with no new event over I (exists_inert_continuation, cut-lex amalgam over S_X); no-event continuations of one profile have the same natural diagram over X' (sameNaturalDiagram_of_sameProfile_noEvent: Lemma 4.6 on the disjoint slots, Placement.regions); local realizability by Prop 4.2 at a categoricity size (exists_local_placement, D.to_strong/of_strong); σ⁺ stages adjoining failing sets, at most σ + σ² = σ new events. Statement changes: added [CategoricalUnbounded K], ℵ₀ ≤ σ, hnat (parameter diagrams are the natural ones), hcoh (prescriptions restrict coherently). No sorry (axioms: propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound)."
    },
